# Deploy (Agency / enterprise-selling)

## Safe command (preferred)

```bash
./deploy.sh
```

Keeps peer apps on `http://127.0.0.1:5005/`. Live path: `/root/InterpirceORS/publish` on `89.42.199.39` (`agency.service`).

## Variants

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `./deploy.sh --fast` | Short same-port restart |
| `./deploy.sh --full` | Force full rebuild |
| `./deploy.sh --dry-run` | Plan only |
| `./deploy.sh --docker` | Docker path |

## Important

- **Do not** point Agency at ORS port `5000` — ORS is a different app on the same VPS.
- Stable proxy backends: `15005` / `15006` behind `:5005`
- Config: `.env.deploy` (gitignored)
- Help: `./deploy/show-help.sh`
